d":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","review_id":"nue9brfJEYZ6yUBg3VJ5uA","date":"2013-10-07T15:48:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9338143467903137,"text_excerpt":"Mister Gregory's is pretty adorable, and great place to stop in for a delicious light sandwich on the edge of the Quarter. I had the Saltimbocca* served with cornichons (crunchy baby pickles) and a lemonade. It's the right price for the right amount of tasty food. Though the sandwich was thinner than I expected, it was absolutely delicious with a ton of flavor. There are also plenty of other items on the menu that I still want to go back and try. It's the kind of place that serves sandwiches that you could probably try to make yourself, but are so much better when someone else makes them so perfectly. My sandwich was served on a nice paper plate, I just wish that there had been a recyclin..."},{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","review_id":"YUKIIYAEl0RFMu18-yrtAA","date":"2015-08-26T16:08:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9333877563476562,"text_excerpt":"Mister Gregory's is a really charming spot. So happy we found it in the middle of a sweltering New Orleans day. The decor is adorable (tables and chairs made out of recycled materials) and the food was simple but delicious. We had the pain de perdu, which wasn't too sweet or sticky, and a breakfast crepe, which was pretty good. Nothing too special, but we really enjoyed this cafe. It was one of the best lunches we had in NOLA."},{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","review_id":"BxoUkARDAdxKg5yWe2LtIg","date":"2014-07-07T17:13:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9238274097442627,"text_excerpt":"Came here for a late breakfast and started with s tomato bisque (soup, got it for free by checking-in) AMAZING! Iced cafe au lait really really good! And a hot breakfast sandwich: yum! Cozy atmosphere and right across from the Armstrong Park"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","photo_id":"rcri-b808qBu4t_weWhDLA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/rcri-b808qBu4t_weWhDLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9337521195411682},{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","photo_id":"wYNS9JthyjMSXnMD2l0nRw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wYNS9JthyjMSXnMD2l0nRw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8746421337127686},{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","photo_id":"BX62tTQcuX3vi5Kqo1y8QQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BX62tTQcuX3vi5Kqo1y8QQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.864741861820221},{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","photo_id":"EIqBDaWbtU1iH44CVObzwA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/EIqBDaWbtU1iH44CVObzwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8544461727142334},{"business_id":"JsRBXqGj0qeMv77sNXha2Q","photo_id":"JT_FJqlf3Gi7gTDnLUJUig","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JT_FJqlf3Gi7gTDnLUJUig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7781099677085876}]},"notebook_case":null}
